Terminals unused in grammar

    RESERVED
    INTEGER


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: CLASS IDENTIFIER LBRACE DeclList RBRACE

    2 DeclList: DeclList MethodDecl
    3         | DeclList FieldDecl
    4         | DeclList SEMICOLON
    5         | ε

    6 MethodDecl: PUBLIC STATIC MethodHeader MethodBody

    7 FieldDecl: PUBLIC STATIC Type IdentList SEMICOLON
    8          | error SEMICOLON

    9 IdentList: IdentList COMMA IDENTIFIER
   10          | IDENTIFIER

   11 IdentListVar: IdentListVar COMMA IDENTIFIER
   12             | IDENTIFIER

   13 Type: BOOL
   14     | INT
   15     | DOUBLE

   16 MethodHeader: Type IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParamOpt RPAR
   17             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParamOpt RPAR

   18 FormalParamOpt: FormalParams
   19               | ε

   20 FormalParams: NormalParams
   21             | STRING LSQ RSQ IDENTIFIER

   22 NormalParams: Type IDENTIFIER
   23             | NormalParams COMMA Type IDENTIFIER

   24 MethodBody: LBRACE StmtOrVarList RBRACE

   25 StmtOrVarList: StmtOrVarList Statement
   26              | StmtOrVarList VarDecl
   27              | ε

   28 VarDecl: Type IdentListVar SEMICOLON

   29 Statement: LBRACE StmtList RBRACE
   30          | IfStmt
   31          | SEMICOLON
   32          | WHILE LPAR Expr RPAR Statement
   33          | RETURN ExprOpt SEMICOLON
   34          | ExprStmt SEMICOLON
   35          | PRINT LPAR Expr RPAR SEMICOLON
   36          | PRINT LPAR STRLIT RPAR SEMICOLON
   37          | error SEMICOLON

   38 StmtList: StmtList Statement
   39         | ε

   40 IfStmt: IF LPAR Expr RPAR Statement ELSE Statement
   41       | IF LPAR Expr RPAR Statement

   42 ExprOpt: Expr
   43        | ε

   44 ExprStmt: IDENTIFIER LPAR ArgListOpt RPAR
   45         | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR
   46         | IDENTIFIER ASSIGN Expr
   47         | PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ Expr RSQ RPAR

   48 Expr: AssignExpr
   49     | LPAR error RPAR

   50 AssignExpr: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN AssignExpr
   51           | OrExpr

   52 OrExpr: OrExpr OR AndExpr
   53       | AndExpr

   54 AndExpr: AndExpr AND XorExpr
   55        | XorExpr

   56 XorExpr: XorExpr XOR EqExpr
   57        | EqExpr

   58 EqExpr: EqExpr EQ RelExpr
   59       | EqExpr NE RelExpr
   60       | RelExpr

   61 RelExpr: RelExpr LT ShiftExpr
   62        | RelExpr LE ShiftExpr
   63        | RelExpr GT ShiftExpr
   64        | RelExpr GE ShiftExpr
   65        | ShiftExpr

   66 ShiftExpr: ShiftExpr LSHIFT AddExpr
   67          | ShiftExpr RSHIFT AddExpr
   68          | AddExpr

   69 AddExpr: AddExpr PLUS MulExpr
   70        | AddExpr MINUS MulExpr
   71        | MulExpr

   72 MulExpr: MulExpr STAR UnaryExpr
   73        | MulExpr DIV UnaryExpr
   74        | MulExpr MOD UnaryExpr
   75        | UnaryExpr

   76 UnaryExpr: MINUS UnaryExpr
   77          | NOT UnaryExpr
   78          | PLUS UnaryExpr
   79          | PostfixExpr

   80 PostfixExpr: IDENTIFIER DOTLENGTH
   81            | IDENTIFIER LPAR ArgListOpt RPAR
   82            | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR
   83            | PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ Expr RSQ RPAR
   84            | PARSEINT LPAR error RPAR
   85            | LPAR Expr RPAR
   86            | IDENTIFIER
   87            | NATURAL
   88            | DECIMAL
   89            | BOOLLIT

   90 ArgListOpt: ArgList
   91           | ε

   92 ArgList: Expr
   93        | ArgList COMMA Expr


